Qt / PySide6 (LGPL-3.0)
-----------------------
The bundled GUI toolkit (Qt, via PySide6) is used under the terms of the
GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 (LGPL-3.0). Qt is dynamically
linked: the installer ships the Qt shared libraries and the application loads
them at runtime, so they can be replaced with a compatible build. The complete
source code of Teacher's Teammate is publicly available at
https://github.com/JoHoenk/teachers-teammate, satisfying the LGPL relink
requirement.

Optional components
-------------------
Optional OCR, LLM, and privacy features (LangChain, spaCy, PaddleOCR, ...) are
not bundled. They are installed on demand and are governed by their own
licenses.

